                  <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"><p style="text-align:justify;font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0in">ADJUSTMENTS TO EXISTING AWARDS</p><p style="text-align:justify;font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="text-align:justify;font-family:Arial;letter-spacing:0in">We accept “Award Adjustment Appeal” forms to request a decrease or other adjustments to an existing award. We will review your appeal and make appropriate adjustments according to federal and state regulations and funding availability. We will notify you by mail or e-mail, depending on the nature of the adjustment and the decision reached.</p></body>
